	(text "Summary of MCU Connections:\n\n\n- 3x UART\n- 1x I2C\n- 1x SPI\n- 1x SWD\n- 1x SDMMC\n- 1x USB 2.0\n\n- 4x PWM Pins\n- 2z GPIO Toggle\n- 3x Analog In\n\n- 1x Buzzer\n- 2x Pyro Channel Fire Pins\n- 2x Pyro Channel Sense Pins\n- 3x LED PWM\n- 1x Voltage sense"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.982 149.86 0)
